sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant UI as MusicIP UI
    participant S as Discovery Service
    participant M as MusicIP Server
    participant K as Kodi Player

    U->>UI: Generate mix from current discovery song
    UI->>UI: Capture current_song as seed
    UI->>S: Set mix_dialog_active
    Note over S: Auto-skip paused; playback continues
    UI->>U: Show mix parameter dialog

    alt User confirms
        UI->>M: Request mix with captured seed and parameters
        M-->>UI: Track list
        UI->>S: Disable Discovery state
        UI->>K: Stop Discovery playback
        UI->>K: Play generated mix
        UI->>UI: Show generated mix screen
    else User cancels before excerpt length
        UI->>S: Clear mix_dialog_active
        Note over S: Existing excerpt timer continues
        UI->>UI: Return to Discovery screen
    else User cancels after excerpt length
        UI->>S: Clear mix_dialog_active
        UI->>K: GoTo next Discovery song
        UI->>UI: Return to Discovery screen
    end
